OL,3,ANI first minister asks protesters to
OL,4,Astay until midnight as Orange Order
OL,5,Avows to complete parade
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are calling for protesters to
OL,8,Fdisperse - the march will go ahead when
OL,9,Fthe road is clear, the Orange Order
OL,10,Fsays. A "sterile zone" is in place to
OL,11,Fkeep the two sides apart
OL,13,FThe DUP has criticised Sinn Fein's
OL,14,Fparticipation in the protest, and Carla
OL,15,FLockhart MP says there will be
OL,16,F"profound" consequences if the Parade
OL,17,FCommission's determination is not
OL,18,Fupheld
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
