OL,3,AWhy some Indian civil servants become
OL,4,Aheroes for doing their jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the thousands of civil servants
OL,7,Fwho keep India's vast government
OL,8,Fmachinery running, a small number
OL,9,Fbecome unlikely public figures every
OL,10,Ffew years.
OL,12,FTukaram Mundhe, 51, is one of them.
OL,14,FThe commissioner of Maharashtra's Food
OL,15,Fand Drug Administration, he has led a
OL,16,Fseries of enforcement drives since
OL,17,Ftaking charge in May. His teams have
OL,18,Finspected restaurants and other food
OL,19,Fbusinesses, uncovering pest
OL,20,Finfestations, poor hygiene and expired
OL,21,Ffood.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
